FR:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Aujourd'hui, nous fêtons {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Je crois que vous appelez ça la
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}lune d'automne {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}chez vous !
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}La lune n'est pas encore de sortie,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
alors profites-en pour te mettre à
l'aise, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}The moon sure is pretty tonight.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
It looks like some of the songpyeon
rice cakes I ate today!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Qué bonita está la luna, ¿eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Se parece a los pastelitos
"songpyeon" que me he comido.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Der Mond sieht heut Nacht aus wie
ein Songpyeon-Reiskuchen –{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} zum
Anbeißen lecker! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Äh, he he he!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ay bu gece bayağı güzel.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bugün yediğim songpyeon
pirinç lokmalarına benziyor!

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Sizde {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Sonbahar Ayı {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}festivali olduğunu
duydum.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} Bizde de Ay'ın başrolde olduğu
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} diye bir bayram var!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Yılın bu zamanında Ay bayağı ilgi çekiyor.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}
Ben Ay olsaydım,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} herkes bana bakarken
utancımdan yerin dibine girerdim, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bu kasabada {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} denen bir bayramı
kutluyoruz.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sizin {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Sonbahar Ayı {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
festivaline biraz benziyor.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Biz de Ay'ı seyrediyoruz,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama yılın
hasadını da kutluyoruz!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Songpyeon aldın mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Chuseok{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}'ta yediğimiz özel pirinç
lokması o!
Sizin kasabada da benzeri var mı?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}
Bir gün sizin kasabayı da ziyaret etmek
isterim, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
